# Scenario run output: traces, summaries and figures are regenerable and
# large, so they stay out. The PLOTTING SCRIPTS live in the same directory
# and are source — a bare `scenarios/results` swept them up too, which is
# how commit cbd3179 ("R79 results") shipped the harness and the controller
# changes but none of the code that draws the R79 figures.
scenarios/results/*
!scenarios/results/*.py

